    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u4kq](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u4kq) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 194.632 depth occurred on Oct 24 2026 42km SW of Gaua Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.5918 longitude 167.3063. It impacted 2846 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
